      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm disappearing already. lately i'll be in the middle of a sentence and the words just... evaporate. it’s not even just forgetting things, it’s like the person who used to live in my head is being replaced by someone else. someone empty. i'm terrified of what happens when there's nothing left of \"me\" to even realize what's happened.",
